The provision of Data is necessary for the performance of an agreement with you and/or for any pre-contractual obligations thereof;
The processing is necessary for compliance with a legal obligation to which we are subject;
The processing is related to a task that is carried out in the public interest or in the exercise of official authority vested in us;
